                <created>Fri, 15 Sep 2017 15:57:06 +0000</created>
                <updated>Mon, 18 Sep 2017 20:12:42 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Mon, 18 Sep 2017 20:12:40 +0000</resolved>
                                                    <fixVersion>2.3</fixVersion>
                                    <component>sql</component>
                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>2</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16169224" author="vozerov" created="Sun, 17 Sep 2017 07:59:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=al.psc&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;al.psc&quot;&gt;al.psc&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=skalashnikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;skalashnikov&quot;&gt;skalashnikov&lt;/a&gt;, I debugged the problem.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgniteSqlNotNullConstraintTest&lt;/tt&gt; performs all SQL operations against client node. And our DDL engine doesn&apos;t wait for clients to respond before completing client future. For this reason, by the time client is notified about successfull completion, it might not have applied changes yet. &lt;tt&gt;CREATE TABLE&lt;/tt&gt; is not affected by this problem because we have special re-try logic for this. But &lt;tt&gt;ALTER TABLE&lt;/tt&gt; is affected. I think &lt;tt&gt;CREATE INDEX&lt;/tt&gt; is also broken.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When I changed the test so that SQL is executed on server nodes, everything works fine.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16169227" author="vozerov" created="Sun, 17 Sep 2017 08:08:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;May be we can just wait for local client futures. Need to investigate this further.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16170457" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 18 Sep 2017 18:31:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user alexpaschenko opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2688&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2688&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6403&quot; title=&quot;IgniteSqlNotNullConstraintTest.testTransactionalAddColumnNotNullCheckDmlInsertValues fails periodically&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6403&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6403&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; SchemaOperationManager fix&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &#8230;tiated operation.&lt;/p&gt;

