&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&lt;/a&gt; ignite-6403&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

